cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use fieldmesh, please cite it as below."
title: "fieldmesh: layer zero of a farmer-owned farm stack"
abstract: >-
  The data and device contract underneath a farmer-owned farm stack: an OGC
  SensorThings 1.1 view over an append-only log the farmer owns, quality judgements
  that carry their provenance, a wire format for unreliable radio links, a simulated
  farm that tests it, and a planting advisor built on top. Pre-release.
type: software
